          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Yannic",
            text: _("So it is true, Owaec and Gweddry survived! When your forces had not returned to Wesnoth by winter I feared the worst. I am relieved to see you alive and well! This is the first good news I’ve heard of the war in quite some time."),
          },
